  "description": "MAWTOU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H112 O22 Sm4,3(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm1A (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2A (Sm) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.790-3.943 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.68-110.22°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150H112O22Sm4·3(C7H8). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
